          1
        ],
        "anchor": "three right-"
      },
      "value": "GSM x SU(nv) x U1chi; two hidden flavours U,Ubar,C,Cbar fundamental/anti-fundamental, three neutrino singlets and complex phi. TableI is in common left-chiral SM q,ubar,dbar,L,eplus convention: chi charges -1/5,-1/5,3/5,3/5,-1/5,N=-1,H=2/5,phi=2. Table neutrino N is the left-chiral charge-conjugate coordinate, despite prose right-handed species naming: Majorana coupling NNphi is neutral. Retain table charges, do not conjugate this already conjugate coordinate twice."
    },
