        "anchor": "simple case nv = 3, k = 0"
      },
      "value": "Source explicitly specializes nv=3,k=0,qplus=-2; qminus=0 from qplus+qminus=-2. Uchi charges U=-2,Ubar=0,C=+2,Cbar=0. Joint full spectrum scales chi by5 and ordinary Y by6. One-/two-light-flavour mass regimes share microscopic matter."
